msgctxt "64"
msgid "What can I do for you, little miss? Come to borrow a little spending money?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "No. I'm here to return what I owe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Uh...huh. Your name is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Kaneshiro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Ooh, the bingata folks. Right, right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "So. I can safely assume you brought me eight million yen. Correct?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Actually, it's only two million. It says so on the contract, so that's all "
"I'm paying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Don't you go making shit up outta nowhere, girlie. Now where's the rest of "
"the money?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Like I said, it's all here. Two million yen, plus interest. Why don't you "
"check what we agreed on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Oh, I've got what we agreed on right here, and according to this... You're "
"trying to pull a fast one, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"See? The document states an even eight million⑬and it's been stamped, "
"signed, everything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "But... How can this be? I never signed anything like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Why don't you let me take a look?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Huh? And who might you be? Her boyfriend, her dad, or her hired goon?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Doesn't matter. Just hand over the contract."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"What, so you can pick it apart!? We're running a goddamn business here! "
"What's the world coming to when a client can't trust their lender!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"That's the line you're feeding us? Heh. I'm sure you made some alterations "
"on your end... Otherwise you wouldn't be so paranoid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Paranoid, my ass! You're the one barging in here with all the accusations!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Really... So it's an accusation to ask one's lender to go over the terms of "
"their contract? If that's how collection agencies work these days, your "
"industry is done for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Hah. I'll bet the only reason you know about debt collecting is 'cause "
"you're flat broke!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"And if not... then I'll just have to break you myself! Hope you know a good "
"chiropractor, asshole!"
msgstr ""

